<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Masuk — Hungry</title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet" />
    <style>
        :root {
            --green: #06C167;
            --green-dark: #049a52;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            display: flex;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        /* LEFT PANEL */
        .left-panel {
            width: 45%;
            background: #000;
            color: #fff;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 48px;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
        }

        .logo span {
            color: var(--green);
        }

        .left-headline {
            margin-top: auto;
            padding-bottom: 60px;
        }

        .left-headline h2 {
            font-size: 40px;
            font-weight: 900;
            line-height: 1.1;
            letter-spacing: -1.5px;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }

        .left-headline p {
            color: #aaa;
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .badge-row {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .badge {
            background: #1a1a1a;
            color: #ccc;
            border-radius: 500px;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        /* RIGHT PANEL */
        .right-panel {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: #fff;
            padding: 48px;
        }

        .form-box {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 380px;
        }

        .form-box h1 {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .form-box p.sub {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }

        .error-box {
            background: #fff0f0;
            border: 1px solid #fcc;
            color: #c00;
            padding: 10px 14px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: .5px;
        }

        input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 14px 16px;
            border: 1.5px solid #e0e0e0;
            border-radius: var(--radius, 8px);
            font-size: 15px;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            outline: none;
            transition: border .15s;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        input:focus {
            border-color: #000;
        }

        .btn-black {
            width: 100%;
            background: #000;
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 15px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background .15s;
        }

        .btn-black:hover {
            background: #222;
        }

        .divider {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            color: #aaa;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .divider::before,
        .divider::after {
            content: '';
            flex: 1;
            height: 1px;
            background: #e0e0e0;
        }

        .footer-link {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #666;
            margin-top: 24px;
        }

        .footer-link a {
            color: var(--green);
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .footer-link a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <!-- LEFT BRAND PANEL -->
    <div class="left-panel">
        <div class="logo">HUNGRY</span></div>
        <div class="left-headline">
            <h2>Makanan lezat,<br />sampai di depan pintu.</h2>
            <p style="margin-bottom:28px">Ribuan pilihan menu dari restoran terbaik di kotamu.</p>
            <div class="badge-row">
                <span class="badge">🚀 Pengiriman Cepat</span>
                <span class="badge">🍔 1000+ Menu</span>
                <span class="badge">💳 Pembayaran Aman</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- RIGHT FORM PANEL -->
    <div class="right-panel">
        <div class="form-box">
            <h1>Selamat datang!</h1>
            <p class="sub">Masuk ke akun Hungry-mu</p>

            <% if (error) { %>
                <div class="error-box">⚠️ <%= error %>
                </div>
                <% } %>

                    <form action="/login" method="POST">
                        <label for="email">Email</label>
                        <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="kamu@email.com" required />

                        <label for="password">Password</label>
                        <input type="password" id="password" name="password" placeholder="••••••••" required />

                        <button type="submit" class="btn-black">Masuk →</button>
                    </form>

                    <div class="divider">atau</div>

                    <p class="footer-link">
                        Belum punya akun? <a href="/register">Daftar Gratis</a>
                    </p>
                    <p class="footer-link" style="margin-top:10px">
                        <a href="/" style="color:#aaa; font-weight:500">← Kembali ke beranda</a>
                    </p>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>

</html>